  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "本体如何存储（observed）",
      "items": [
        "03_core/<域>/version=<日期>/：entities 19 · relations 17 · segments 21",
        "RELEASE.md 冻结发布 + CURRENT.md 指活动版本；内容级 sha256",
        "KERT 不自建 RDF 本体；OWL/SHACL 权威在 GITS，只读引用"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "本体如何物化（observed）",
      "items": [
        "ProjectionBuilder.build() → 6 张 Parquet + PROJECTION.md + logical_hash",
        "G4 门禁：relations→entities 外键完整、segments content 非空",
        "KuzuGraphBuilder → Company 节点 + Rel 关系（带 statement_id 溯源）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "本体如何被 LLM 理解（observed）",
      "items": [
        "LLM 不读本体：ki_map() 从 segments 投影取 7 条 KI 文本拼入 prompt",
        "供应链图谱另走一路：从 Kuzu 库确定性构建，model=library",
        "路由：registry 5 内置 + SP-15 条件注册 + 动态包；_executor 为 if/elif"
      ]
    }
  ]
